@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
left to right direction
rectangle "Adaptive Application\n(for example Fusion)" as APP
rectangle "Libraries of other clusters\n(ara::com, ara::exec, ara::per, ...)" as FCL
rectangle "ara::core\n(in the same process)" as CORE
rectangle "stderr of the process" as ERR
rectangle "Log and Trace\n(DLT, context ID of core,\nof the cluster or of EM)" as DLT
rectangle "Execution Management" as EM
rectangle "State Management" as SM
APP --> CORE : Initialize, Result, Future,\nErrorCode, types
APP --> FCL : cluster APIs
FCL --> CORE : Result, Future, ErrorCode,\nViolations
CORE ..> ERR : Abort: message
CORE ..> DLT : AbortMessage, violation messages
CORE ..> EM : process terminates abnormally
EM ..> SM : Undefined Function Group State
@enduml
